    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: ["Docker's decisive contribution to the infrastructure stack is the elimination of environment parity problems. \"Works on my machine\" is a symptom of environmental inconsistency between development, staging, and production. A Docker image carries its environment with it. The same image SHA that passed CI runs in staging and is promoted to production. This immutability is a guarantee that the previous generation of application deployment - copying source code to servers, running ", _jsx(_components.code, {
        children: "npm install"
