          }), " Decide explicitly: Terraform owns cloud resources and cluster-level Kubernetes infrastructure, Docker owns image building and artifact management, Ansible owns post-provisioning OS configuration, and Kubernetes manifests (managed via CI or GitOps) own application workloads. Write this down. Enforce it in repository structure and CI pipeline design."]
        }), "\n"]
      }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.li, {
        children: ["\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
