          }), " Every IP address, endpoint, ARN, and cluster name that Terraform creates should be exposed as an output and consumed by Ansible's dynamic inventory, the CI pipeline's environment variables, and Kubernetes external secrets references. Never hardcode infrastructure-generated values in playbooks or manifests."]
        }), "\n"]
      }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.li, {
